[center][size=5][b]FICture2 – Ultra-Fast Image Compare & DDS Texture Viewer for Modders[/b][/size][/center]

[b]FICture2[/b] is an ultra-lightweight, high-performance image viewer and comparison tool built specifically for game modders and texture artists.

The entire executable is [b]under 1 MB[/b], with near-instant startup time — no splash screen, no heavy frameworks, no delay.
Double-click a texture and you're already comparing it.

