[size=4][b]🆕 v1.1 What's New[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Archive browsing: ZIP / 7Z / RAR / BA2 (images + folders)
[*]Sampling quality toggle (low/high) for scaled images
[*]Max zoom increased to 5000%
[*]Renderer info shown in the title bar (D2D / D3D11)
[*]Multi-file drag & drop (up to 4 viewers side-by-side)
[*]Register file associations from the context menu
[*]See DDS thumbnails directly in Windows Explorer (enable from the context menu; admin prompt)
[/list]

[size=4][b]⚡ Why FICture2 Exists[/b][/size]

Most image viewers claim to support DDS —
but in reality:

[list]
[*]BCn formats are often decoded incorrectly
[*]Alpha channels are mishandled or ignored
[*]Mip levels are flattened or forced
[*]Performance collapses on large texture folders
[/list]

[b]FICture2 was built because no existing lightweight tool handled DDS BCn textures correctly and fast enough for real modding workflows.[/b]

[size=4][b]🧬 Proper DDS & BCn Support (Not "Partial" Support)[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Native DDS support via DirectXTex
[*]Correct decoding of BC1 / BC3 / BC4 / BC5 / BC6H / BC7
[*]Accurate alpha channel handling
[*]No forced recompression
[*]No incorrect color-space shortcuts
[/list]

What you see in FICture2 is what the engine actually gets.

[size=4][b]🖼️ Fast Image Viewing[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Instant loading of large DDS textures
[*]Optimized thumbnail generation for massive mod folders
[*]Smooth zoom & pan with mouse-centric controls
[*]Designed for inspection, not editing
[/list]

[size=4][b]🔄 Image Compare Mode (Side-by-Side)[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Compare 2–4 images simultaneously
[*]Perfect for A/B testing multiple texture replacements
[*]Split-view comparison with synchronized navigation
[/list]

[b]Folder-to-Folder Sync (Compare Mode)[/b]

When comparing two folders:
[list]
[*]Selecting an image in one panel automatically selects the same filename in the other
[*]Ideal for vanilla vs modded textures
[*]Ideal for competing retextures and conflict resolution
[/list]

[size=4][b]🧩 Built for Vortex Mod Manager Users[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Automatic side-by-side comparison of conflicted files
[*]Conflicting textures are paired automatically
[*]Zero manual setup
[/list]

FICture2 is a natural companion tool for Vortex.

[size=4][b]📁 Modder-Centric Image Browser[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Images and subfolders (including ..)
[*]Folder previews with embedded image thumbnails
[*]Handles real mod directory structures
[/list]

[size=4][b]🧭 Quick Usage Tips[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Drag & drop images/folders/archives to open quickly (drop multiple files to open up to 4 views)
[*]Right-click the main view to register file associations for supported image types
[*]Right-click to register DDS thumbnails in Explorer (admin prompt appears)
[/list]

[size=4][b]⌨️ Hotkeys (Everyday Use)[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Mouse wheel: zoom (Shift + wheel = smaller steps)
[*]Left mouse drag: pan
[*]Left / Right: move selection in the thumbnail list
[*]Enter: open selected image/folder
[*]Backspace / Alt + Up: go to parent folder
[*]N: show/hide folders (including ..)
[*]Q: toggle sampling quality (sharp pixels vs smooth)
[*]Ctrl + O: open and replace current view
[*]Ctrl + Shift + O: open a new view (up to 4)
[/list]

[size=4][b]🖱️ Drag & Drop Behavior[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Drop on left 3/4: replace current view (red overlay)
[*]Drop on right 1/4: open as a new view (green overlay)
[*]Unsupported files show an X cursor and are ignored
[/list]

[size=4][b]⚙️ Ultra-Light, Zero Bloat[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Executable size: under 1 MB
[*]Near-instant cold start
[*]No runtime frameworks
[*]No background services
[/list]

